1
00:00:00,347 --> 00:00:03,437
Plus, I've been kind of talking
some smack about you.

2
00:00:04,434 --> 00:00:07,724
(Bernadette:)-Hello, Howard.
-Wait, Bernadette, I need to talk to you.

3
00:00:07,896 --> 00:00:10,526
-I can't. I'm working.
-This will only take a second.

4
00:00:10,690 --> 00:00:14,190
(Howard:)You asked me to think about
where our relationship was going...

5
00:00:14,361 --> 00:00:16,031
(Howard:)...and I did.

6
00:00:17,030 --> 00:00:18,700
(Penny:)Bernadette...

7
00:00:22,410 --> 00:00:24,040
(Howard:)...will you marry me?

8
00:00:26,081 --> 00:00:29,211
(Bernadette:)Is this more comedy
that I don't understand?

9
00:00:29,876 --> 00:00:31,966
(Howard:)No, I'm serious.

10
00:00:32,170 --> 00:00:34,710
I'm never gonna find another girl
like you...

11
00:00:34,881 --> 00:00:39,551
(Howard:)...who likes me and is, you know, real.

12
00:00:40,720 --> 00:00:43,720
(Bernadette:)-So this isn't a joke?
-No.

13
00:00:43,890 --> 00:00:46,060
(Bernadette:)Then you're insane.

14
00:00:46,226 --> 00:00:49,566
(Howard:)I prefer to think of myself as quirky.

15
00:00:49,729 --> 00:00:53,979
(Bernadette:)Howard, we've only been on three dates.
We haven't even had sex yet.

16
00:00:54,192 --> 00:00:57,232
(Howard:)Fair enough. When's your break?

17
00:00:57,904 --> 00:01:01,024
(Bernadette:)Wow.

